<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell three points to 1,283.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell three points to 1,283.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,283 today from 1,286 on June 19, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1365    12.394	  1366    12.400</p>
<p>   1a   1300  9844.000	  1304  9879.000</p>
